  "stem": "A newborn baby has bile-stained vomiting since birth and irritability. An abdominal X-ray is performed, followed by an upper gastrointestinal contrast study. What is the most likely diagnosis?",
  "questionType": "SBA",
  "options": [
    {
      "key": "A",
      "text": "Midgut volvulus",
      "isCorrect": true
    },
    {
      "key": "B",
